# Netlify SPA fallback for Maniesta Career OS
#
# All app routes serve index.html with status 200 so React Router can
# handle navigation client-side. Deep links like /pricing, /blog/some-slug,
# /builder/abc123, and /admin/users all resolve to index.html and the client
# renders the correct page.
#
# Existing static files (JS, CSS, images, fonts under /static/* and
# /assets/*) are served first by Netlify automatically - no explicit
# rules are needed for them. Netlify only falls through to the catch-all
# below when no real file matches the requested path.

/*    /index.html   200